			"name": "Garden of Thorns",
			"tooltip": "Zyra spawns <keywordMajor>Seeds</keywordMajor> around herself every @SeedCooldown@ seconds that last 30 seconds. She can have 8 <keywordMajor>Seeds</keywordMajor> planted at once. If an enemy champion steps on a <keywordMajor>Seed</keywordMajor>, it dies. Zyra will not spawn <keywordMajor>Seeds</keywordMajor> while hiding in brush.<br><br>These <keywordMajor>Seeds</keywordMajor> are used by her other Abilities to spawn plants that deal <magicDamage>@PlantDamage@ magic damage</magicDamage>.",
			"tooltipExtended": "Zyra spawns <keywordMajor>Seeds</keywordMajor> around herself every @SeedCooldown@ seconds that last 30 seconds. She can have 8 <keywordMajor>Seeds</keywordMajor> planted at once. If an enemy champion steps on a <keywordMajor>Seed</keywordMajor>, it dies. Zyra will not spawn <keywordMajor>Seeds</keywordMajor> while hiding in brush.<br><br>These <keywordMajor>Seeds</keywordMajor> are used by her other Abilities to spawn plants that deal <magicDamage>@PlantDamage@ magic damage</magicDamage>.<br><br><rules>Zyra's plants deal <magicDamage>@MonsterMod@ bonus magic damage</magicDamage> to monsters.</rules> "
